{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Terraces is an <strong>idle-farming game</strong>, where you can watch tiny guys do different tasks around the terrace as you work on things outside the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Crops:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant crops and watch as the tiny guys manage the garden plots by watering, weeding, and harvesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136330/extras/14199aa96a49869a8bdbdc1a5f0e475d.poster.avif?t=1753981105\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136330/extras/14199aa96a49869a8bdbdc1a5f0e475d.webm?t=1753981105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136330/extras/14199aa96a49869a8bdbdc1a5f0e475d.mp4?t=1753981105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Tiny Guys:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use certain crops and tiny guy parts to craft more tiny guys to help manage the terrace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136330/extras/9fdce604d82c571afbed791243a15685.poster.avif?t=1753981105\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136330/extras/9fdce604d82c571afbed791243a15685.webm?t=1753981105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136330/extras/9fdce604d82c571afbed791243a15685.mp4?t=1753981105\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use money produced from crops to buy decorations to detail your terrace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3136330/extras/aad36aa9ff5a141b284c888de65d70ee.avif?t=1753981105\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist :)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sow It Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/28db82e89b9612288e8b3837e73c39d26ee489ca.jpg"},{"name":"Sprout Scout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/c7c52ef3c31b0f5b9806a4a1062505b825b99252.jpg"},{"name":"Crop Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/0427f75f1fe2bb4948b40b47ec2c695b1a1a51eb.jpg"},{"name":"Harvest Hobbyist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/578755d6265e155440ac4622589a5d25fe9d37ac.jpg"},{"name":"Seed Specialist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/a894e5f84d68ba6dffbd85001788ff52c4efa02e.jpg"},{"name":"Root Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/bf644ea97ada78617dcdf93d50a6ce80c8ead37f.jpg"},{"name":"Supreme Sower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/2156459497c6230c53f36aac6cb7880c92cd5ce9.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Plantening","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/0942fdc696616a8ebab7a1c86fac9ebe0c97c51d.jpg"},{"name":"Sprinkle of Style","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136330/2ed993800ead2d9cc31d38c35e4bab0544f8423f.jpg"},{"name":"Budding Design","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3136